		for reimbursement, cost of cover or damages arising from suspension or termination.
	</p>
	<h3>3.3 Effect of Termination</h3>
	<p>
		Upon termination you must stop using the Service, and Double Up’s obligation to provide it ends. The Double
		Up discount stops applying once the Service is uninstalled. You remain obligated to pay all fees
